Creative Commons Zero v1.0 Universal (CC0 1.0)
================================================================================

THIS LICENCE APPLIES ONLY TO THE FILES IN THIS `contracts/` DIRECTORY.

The rest of this repository is covered by the proprietary licence in the LICENSE
file at the repository root, which reserves essentially all rights. These files
are deliberately carved out of it.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WHY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The files here are data contracts, not implementation. A contract exists to be
implemented by people who are not the author - that is the whole point of one -
and a schema published under a licence that forbids reuse is not a contract, it
is a document describing a contract that nobody is permitted to honour.

Concretely: `career-graph.v1.schema.json` is the input format for a separate
renderer. Anyone producing a career graph for that renderer, or writing a
different renderer that consumes the same shape, must be free to copy this file,
derive from it, generate types from it, embed it in their own software, and ship
that software commercially, without asking anyone.

CC0 gives them that with no attribution requirement and no viral obligation,
which is the correct trade for a file whose value comes from being widely
implemented rather than from being owned.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
THE DEDICATION
