Full text: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WHAT THIS DOES NOT COVER
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

- Any source code in this repository outside `contracts/`.
- The implementation that produces documents in this format.
- Any renderer that consumes this format.
- The name "Chronicle", the site's written content, or its visual design.

A licence on a format grants nothing over the software at either end of it.
